### 註冊（成功會直接登入，回應 body 有 accessToken，refresh token 在 Set-Cookie）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "demo-password-123",
  "displayName": "示範帳號"
}

### 登入，把 accessToken 存起來給下面用
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "demo-password-123"
}

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 查自己的資料（要帶 access token）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 沒帶 token：應該回 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/me

### 密碼錯誤：應該回 401「Email 或密碼錯誤」
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 換新 token（IntelliJ 會自動帶上前面拿到的 cookie）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 登出：refresh token 作廢、access token 加入黑名單
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 登出後再用同一個 access token：應該回 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
